    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>PUBLISH YOUR GAMES WITH US!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/087a625b734d3385cefd1f6e43daa848.avif?t=1755610972\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/de313c4e2b09c32a8cbc1febf4882239.avif?t=1755610972\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><br>Get ready to enter a network of futuristic puzzles where every room challenges your intellect. In Cube Mind, every element in the environment is more than just decoration \u2014 it\u2019s a strategic tool you must learn to master.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Activators</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/530f921b36d96410e86a009410127a56.poster.avif?t=1755610972\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/530f921b36d96410e86a009410127a56.webm?t=1755610972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/530f921b36d96410e86a009410127a56.mp4?t=1755610972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Trigger mechanisms, open doors, and reshape the level by placing cubes with precision. These smart switches react to your actions, ready to set key events in motion.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boosters</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/e8f7005f0f5b6b89b30a42c21344b0e1.poster.avif?t=1755610972\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/e8f7005f0f5b6b89b30a42c21344b0e1.webm?t=1755610972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/e8f7005f0f5b6b89b30a42c21344b0e1.mp4?t=1755610972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Need to reach new heights? These kinetic modules launch cubes \u2014 and even yourself \u2014 across the environment. Learn to control their direction and power to solve puzzles with flair.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Respawners</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/daa3a4129c627ac27529c42ac8fe8e43.poster.avif?t=1755610972\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/daa3a4129c627ac27529c42ac8fe8e43.webm?t=1755610972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/daa3a4129c627ac27529c42ac8fe8e43.mp4?t=1755610972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Never worry about losing a cube. These generators ensure you can always reset your strategy and try again without restarting the entire level.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lasers</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/b4103a45d2acd18a0280e07a2295b99a.poster.avif?t=1755610972\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/b4103a45d2acd18a0280e07a2295b99a.webm?t=1755610972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/b4103a45d2acd18a0280e07a2295b99a.mp4?t=1755610972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Energy is everything. Redirect laser beams through reflection and precise alignment to unlock new areas. A single millimeter can mean the difference between success and reset.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/de313c4e2b09c32a8cbc1febf4882239.avif?t=1755610972\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><br>Get ready to enter a network of futuristic puzzles where every room challenges your intellect. In Cube Mind, every element in the environment is more than just decoration \u2014 it\u2019s a strategic tool you must learn to master.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Activators</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/530f921b36d96410e86a009410127a56.poster.avif?t=1755610972\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/530f921b36d96410e86a009410127a56.webm?t=1755610972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/530f921b36d96410e86a009410127a56.mp4?t=1755610972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Trigger mechanisms, open doors, and reshape the level by placing cubes with precision. These smart switches react to your actions, ready to set key events in motion.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Boosters</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/e8f7005f0f5b6b89b30a42c21344b0e1.poster.avif?t=1755610972\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/e8f7005f0f5b6b89b30a42c21344b0e1.webm?t=1755610972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/e8f7005f0f5b6b89b30a42c21344b0e1.mp4?t=1755610972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Need to reach new heights? These kinetic modules launch cubes \u2014 and even yourself \u2014 across the environment. Learn to control their direction and power to solve puzzles with flair.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Respawners</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/daa3a4129c627ac27529c42ac8fe8e43.poster.avif?t=1755610972\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/daa3a4129c627ac27529c42ac8fe8e43.webm?t=1755610972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/daa3a4129c627ac27529c42ac8fe8e43.mp4?t=1755610972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Never worry about losing a cube. These generators ensure you can always reset your strategy and try again without restarting the entire level.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lasers</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/b4103a45d2acd18a0280e07a2295b99a.poster.avif?t=1755610972\" width=616 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/b4103a45d2acd18a0280e07a2295b99a.webm?t=1755610972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654570/extras/b4103a45d2acd18a0280e07a2295b99a.mp4?t=1755610972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Energy is everything. Redirect laser beams through reflection and precise alignment to unlock new areas. A single millimeter can mean the difference between success and reset.",
